{"id": "tatoeba-es-0000", "text": "Decidí decirle que lo quiero.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0001", "text": "¿A qué periódicos te suscribiste?", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0002", "text": "No tienen absolutamente nada en común.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0003", "text": "No sabía qué hacer con la comida extra.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0004", "text": "Esta es su letra, pero no está firmada.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0005", "text": "Yo tengo dos hermanas.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0006", "text": "Él tiene un amplio horizonte.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0007", "text": "¿Cuánto tiempo duran tus vacaciones de primavera?", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0008", "text": "Esta jarra de cerveza contiene una pinta.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0009", "text": "Pero, ¿cuánto es eso?", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0010", "text": "La fuerte lluvia me impidió ir.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0011", "text": "Mi abuelo me hablaba con una pipa en la boca.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0012", "text": "No importa qué equipo gane el partido.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0013", "text": "Había dos bomberos españoles llamados José y Josbí.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0014", "text": "Él elaboró una nueva formula.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0015", "text": "Me temo que tú tendrás que trabajar horas extra.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0016", "text": "Hubo algunos que no entendieron el chiste.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0017", "text": "Ve y ve por ti mismo qué ha ocurrido.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0018", "text": "Cosas buenas les tocan a aquellos que esperan.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-es-0019", "text": "Por supuesto, hubo conciertos en la ciudad.", "lang": "es", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
